Pi (packages/coding-agent, packages/ai, packages/tui)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.1.0, revision abe508e1b89912adde45528136c3221eb69acdd7.
Ported: the session manager (src/core/session-manager.ts), the session
working-directory checks (src/core/session-cwd.ts), the coding-agent message
types and converters (src/core/messages.ts), the path helpers the session
manager uses (src/utils/paths.ts), Pi's UUIDv7 generator
(packages/ai/src/utils/uuid.ts), and the session-manager tests under test/,
in src/session/.
From release v1.2.0, revision 06a466935536f8c9bcacb2d5efc0fc021be1bdff: the
runtime fork of src/core/agent-session-runtime.ts (createBranchedSession)
adapted in src/session/manager.rs (branched_copy); session search,
src/modes/interactive/components/session-selector-search.ts
(parseSearchQuery, matchSession, filterAndSortSessions, hasSessionName,
without the threaded sort), in src/session/search.rs, with the cases of
test/session-selector-search.test.ts in src/session/search_tests.rs; the
fuzzy matching of packages/tui/src/fuzzy.ts (fuzzyMatch, fuzzyFilter) in
src/session/fuzzy.rs, with the cases of packages/tui/test/fuzzy.test.ts; and
the locked file backends of src/core/settings-manager.ts
(FileSettingsStorage) and src/core/auth-storage.ts (FileAuthStorageBackend)
in src/json_store/.
From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0: the
orphaned tool-call rule of transformMessages
(packages/ai/src/api/transform-messages.ts, its second pass), adapted as the
unanswered-call projection in src/session/unanswered.rs.
